<title>UK: Eurofima calls 60 million Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>Eurofima calls 60 million Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurofima said it has called a 60 million Swiss franc private placement for early redemption.</p>
<p>The six percent bond maturing in 1998 will be called on November 13 at 101.00, Eurofima said in a statement.</p>
<p>Eurofima is the European Company for the Financing of Railroad Rolling Stock.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
